# Survival's way in, through the real keys, on the world a normal start makes:
#   tools/tour.sh tours/survival.tour
# Driftwood off the strand survival lays by the spawn, dead wood under a dead tree,
# a loose stone, then a fire laid with two presses of use, seen at night.
shot 01-spawn
# Driftwood on the strand a few steps east of the spawn: turn to it, press use once.
at 136.0,213.5
walk 1,1 0.08
press use 0.1
wait 0.45
shot 02-gathering-driftwood
wait 1.3
shot 03-driftwood-taken
# Dead wood under the dead tree to the north-east: hold use and it gives twice.
at 139.1,210.35
walk 1,1 0.08
press use 3.2
wait 0.3
shot 04-dead-wood-picked-over
# A loose stone off each of two boulders.
at 146.1,207.55
walk 1,1 0.08
press use 0.1
wait 1.6
at 140.4,197.6
walk 1,1 0.08
press use 0.1
wait 1.6
shot 05-stone
# Open ground: the first press asks and rings the spot, the second lays the fire.
at 143.5,205.5
walk 1,-1 0.08
press use 0.1
wait 0.3
shot 06-asked
press use 0.1
wait 1.5
shot 07-fire-laid
hour 21.5
wait 1.0
shot 08-fire-at-night
# Lie down by it: the night passes and the fire has burnt through to morning.
press use 0.1
wait 1.0
shot 09-morning
